mrīṃmāhendryainamaḥ oṃ śrīṃśāṃkaryaina

<pṛ0 19a> maḥ madhye klīṃhlīṃbagalāmukhyaina
maḥ dvārapūjāṃcasaṃpādyaprāṇāyā
matrayaṃcaret prāṇāyāmatrayaṃkṛ
tvāsvamūlenacasādhakaḥ svamaṃtreṇacare

<pṛ0 19ba> nmaṃtrīsadyoviṣṭaraśodhanam oṃa
syaśrīāsanaśodhanamaṃtrasya meru
pṛṣṭṛṣiḥ sutalaṃcchaṃdaḥkūrmodeva
tā śeṣitivījam digannāgāiti

<pṛ0 20a> śaktiḥ dharaṇīpatiritikīlaka
m āsanaśodhaneviniyogaḥ oṃ
hlīṃprīṃpretāsanāyanamaḥ oṃhrāṃśrīṃ
śivarūpiṇaisadāśivāyanamaḥ  

<pṛ0 20ba> oṃhrīṃsahasradalapadmāsanāyana
maḥ oṃhrīṃmaṇimaṃḍapavedikāsa
nāyanamaḥ oṃhlīṃprīṃdevīvāhanāya
mahākālāyanamaḥphaṭsvāhā ityāsa

<pṛ0 21a> naṃcasaṃśodhyaprāṇāyāmatrayaṃcaret 
suśikhāṃcaivagāyatrīṃsvamūlenārca
yetsudhīḥ gāyatryācaivasaṃpūjyani
pīyācamanatrayaṃ japenmūlaṃyathāśa

<pṛ0 21ba> ktyākṛtvānyāsādikaṃtathā dhyātvā
devīṃmaheśānipūjayedvagalāmukhī
m oṃasyaśrīvrāhmāstravidyāśrība
galāmukhīmaṃtrasya vrahmāṛṣiḥuśni

<pṛ0 22a> kchaṃdaḥ śrīvagalāmukhīdevatā
hllīṃvījaṃ oṃśaktiḥ svāhākīla
kaṃ śrīcaturvidhapuruṣārthejapevi
niyogaḥ oṃathamūlaṃ oṃhlīṃbaga

<pṛ0 22ba> lāmukhisarvaṃduṣṭavācaṃmukhaṃpadaṃstaṃ
bhayastaṃbhaya jihvāṃkīlaya (2) vuddhiṃvinā
śaya (2) hlīṃoṃsvāhā itimūlam oṃ
athanyāsaḥ vrahmāṛṣayenamaḥ śi

<pṛ0 23a> rasi uśnikchaṃdasenamaḥmukhe va
galāmukhīdevatāyainamaḥ hṛdi 
hlīṃvījāyanamaḥ guhye oṃśaktiye
namaḥ pādayoḥ svāhākīlakāyaina

<pṛ0 23ba> maḥ nābhau sarvāṃgeṣu oṃśivatatvāna
maḥ śirasi oṃgurutatvāyanamaḥ mu
khe śaktitatvāyanamaḥ hṛdaye vra
hmāstravidyātatvāyanamaḥ nābhau 

<pṛ0 24a> śivaśaktitatvāyanamaḥ sarvāṃgeṣu 
ititatvanyāsaḥ oṃathamātṛkā
nyāsaḥ oṃaṃāṃiṃīṃhlāṃnamaḥ śira
si uṃūṃṛṃṛṃhlīṃnamaḥ mukhe ḷṃḹṃ

<pṛ0 24ba> eṃeṃhluṃnamaḥnābhau oṃoṃauṃaṃaṃḥhlaḥna
maḥsarvāṃgeṣu kaṃkhaṃgaṃghaṃṅaṃyaṃhlāṃnamaḥ
śirasi caṃchaṃjaṃjhaṃñaṃhlīṃnamaḥmukhe 
ṭaṃṭhaṃḍaṃḍhaṃṇaṃlaṃhlūṃnamaḥ hṛdaye | 

<pṛ0 25a> taṃthaṃdaṃdhaṃnaṃvaṃhlaiṃnamaḥ nābhau paṃphaṃ
vaṃbhaṃmaṃyaṃraṃlaṃvaṃhlauṃḥnamaḥ pādayoḥ 
śaṃṣaṃsaṃhaṃlaṃkṣaṃhlaḥnamaḥ sarvāṃgeṣu 
itivarṇanyāsaḥ athamūlamaṃtranyāsa 

<pṛ0 25ba> hlāṃaṃguṣṭābhyāṃnamaḥ hlīṃtarjanībhyāṃna
maḥ hluṃmadhyamābhyāṃnamaḥ hlaiṃanāmi
kābhyāṃnamaḥ hlauṃkaniṣṭikābhyāṃna
maḥ hlaḥkaratalakarapṛṣṭābhyāṃnamaḥ 

<pṛ0 26a> athahṛdayādinyāsaḥ hlāṃhṛdayāya
namaḥ hlīṃśirasesvāhā hluṃśikhāyai
vaṣaṭ hlaiṃkavacāyahuṃ hlauṃnetratrayā
yaivaṣaṭ hlaḥastrāyaphaṭ evaṃnyāsa

<pṛ0 26ba> vidhiṃkṛtvādhyāyeddevīcasādhakaḥ ma
dhyesvadhāvdimaṇimaṃḍaparatnavedyāṃsiṃ
hāsanoparigatāṃparipītavarṇāṃ pī
tāṃvarābharaṇamālyavibhūṣitāṃgīṃde(-)

<pṛ0 27a> vīṃsmarāmidhṛtamudgaravairijihvām 
itidhyātvājapaṃkuryātsādhakomaṃtra
sādhakaḥ japaṃkṛtvāyathāśaktyāyaṃ
trapūjāṃsamārabhet athapūjāpaddhati 

<pṛ0 27ba> prathamaṃpūjayenmaṃtrīdvārapālānsu
reśvari tatoṣṭudevīsaṃpūjyacatasraḥ
sādhakorcayet tatoṣṭadevīsaṃpūjya
sādhakomaṃtrasādhakaḥ japaṃkṛtvāya

<pṛ0 28a> thāśaktyāyaṃtrapūjāṃsamārabhet 
yaṃtramadhyercayenmaṃtrīnavamīṃbaga
lāmukhīm athadvārapālapūjā 
oṃgluṃgaṃgaṇeśaṃpūjayāminamaḥ 

<pṛ0 28ba> itisaṃkalpaḥ oṃhrīṃśrīṃglauṃgaṇeśā
yaguṃūṭhaḥṭhaḥṭhaḥsvāhā itipūrve oṃhrāṃ
hlīṃvīṃvaruṇāyakuṃṭhaḥṭhaḥṭhaḥsvāhā 
itipaścime oṃśrīṃhrīṃśrīṃśrīdāya

<pṛ0 29a> krīṃkuverāyakrūṃṭhaḥṭhaḥṭhaḥsvāhā ityutta
re oṃśrīṃhrīṃklīṃdrīṃdharmarājāyakrūṃṭhaḥ
ṭhaḥṭhaḥsvāhāitidakṣiṇe itidvārapā
lapūjā athāṣṭadalapūjā || 

<pṛ0 29ba> oṃvālāṃpūjayāminamaḥ aiṃklīṃsauṃḥ
vālāyainamaḥ itipūrve oṃsauṃḥbharga
śikhāyainamaḥ ityagnikoṇe oṃśrīṃ
hrīṃduṃdurgāyainamaḥ itidakṣiṇe oṃoṃ

<pṛ0 30a> hrīṃoṃśrīṃaiṃsauṃḥbhavānyainamaḥ iti
ninṛtidale krīṃkrīṃkrīṃhruṃhruṃhrīṃhrīṃbhaiṃ
bhadrakālibhaiṃhrīṃhrīṃhruṃhruṃkrīṃkrīṃkrīṃ
svāhābhadrakālyainamaḥ itipaścime 

<pṛ0 30ba> oṃhroṃbhaiṃbhagāvāsāyainamaḥ itivā
yukoṇe oṃhrīṃśrīṃklīṃmahāmāyāyai
namaḥ ityuttare śrīṃhrīṃklīṃaiṃsauṃḥvaiṃ
daveśvaryainamaḥ itīśāne iticaivama

<pṛ0 31a> ṣṭadevīsaṃpūjyacatasṛdevīḥsaṃpūja
yet oṃhrīṃaiṃsauṃḥsarasvatyainamaḥ i
tipūrve aiṃklīṃsumukhyainamaḥ itidakṣi
ṇe aiṃklīṃsauṃḥbhairavyainamaḥ itipaści

<pṛ0 31ba> me oṃśrīṃaiṃsauṃḥcchrīṃchinnamastikā
yainamaḥ ityuttare iticatasrodaivīḥ
pūjayet ūrdhvasthetārasaṃyuktedale
pūrvercayetsudhīḥ tottalāṃdevadeveśīṃ

<pṛ0 32a> maṃtreṇamāṃtrikottamaḥ oṃśrīṃduṃto
talāyaitraiṃṭhaḥṭhaḥṭhaḥsvāhā itipū
rve oṃkrīṃhruṃsthīṃtāriṇyainamaḥ ityā
gnīyyāṃ oṃśrīṃstrīṃkkuṃtārāyainamaḥ 

<pṛ0 32ba> itidakṣiṇe oṃhrīṃklīṃśrīṃśītalā
yainamaḥ itipaścime(naiṛtyai) oṃṣṭaiṃsauḥkalīṃśrīṃmanonmannāyainamaḥ itipaścime oṃaiṃsauṃḥklīṃvīṃ
vaikharyainamaḥ itivāyavye oṃslīṃkhrīṃ
khecaryainamaḥ ityuttare krīṃkrīṃkrīṃ

<pṛ0 33a> hrīṃhrīṃhruṃhruṃdakṣiṇekālikekrīṃkrīṃ
krīṃhrīṃhrīṃhuṃhuṃsvāhāśyāmābhagava
tyainamaḥ itīśāne yatramadhyasthi
teparttresvāhāvījenamaṃḍite śūnyopa

<pṛ0 33ba> risthitemaṃtrīpūjayedvagalāmukhī
m oṃhlīṃvagalāyakhisarvaduṣṭavā
camukhaṃpadaṃstaṃbhaya (2) jihvāṃkīlaya (2) 
vuddhiṃvināśaya (2) hlīṃoṃsvāhā baga

<pṛ0 34a> lāmukhyaisaparivārāyaisāyudhāyaisa
vāhanāyaihlīṃnamaḥ gaṃdhākṣataprasū
nādyairdhūpadīpādibhistathā naivedyairvi
vidhairdevimakāraipaṃcabhistathā sādha

<pṛ0 34ba> kaḥpūjayeddevīṃmūlenasādhakottamaḥ 
itidevīṃsaṃpūjya pātrāṇipūjaye
t navadevīmūlenanavapātrāṇiśu
nyopariniveśayet oṃhlīṃvagalāmu

<pṛ0 35a> khihlīṃoṃmadhupāṃnidrāṃdrīṃdreṃdraiṃdrauṃdraḥ
śukraśāpaṃmocayamocaya aiṃṭhaḥklīṃ
ṭhaḥsauṭhaḥsvāhā itisaṃpūjyapātrāṇi
dadyānnaivedyamuttamaṃ mūlamaṃtreṇadeve

<pṛ0 35ba> śisādhakaḥsvaphalāptaye oṃhlīṃbaga
lāmukhiimaṃvaliṃgṛhṇa (2) hlīṃoṃsvā
hā itivalimaṃtraḥ tatodevyaipuṣpaṃ
dadyāt devadevijaganmātaḥpī(-)

<pṛ0 36a> tāṃvaravibhūṣite pūjayāvalināde
vipūrṇābhavasadāmama japenastava
rājenanāmnāṃsahasrakenaca deve
śibhuvaneśāni tuṣṭābhavasadāma

<pṛ0 36ba> ma naṃdaṃtusādhakāḥsarvevinaśyaṃtu
vidūṣakaḥ avasthāśāṃbhavīmestupra
sannostuguruḥsadā āhvānaṃnaiva
jānāminaivajānāmipūjanam 

<pṛ0 37a> visarjanaṃnajānāmikṣamyatāṃvaga
lāmukhi itiśrīrahasyātiraha
syebagalāmukhinityapūjāpaddha
tiḥsamāptam śubham || 

<pṛ0 37ba> (ṭḥīṣ FOḻīO īṣ BḻāṇK)

<pṛ0 1a> athakavacaṃpratanyate śrībhairavuvāca
śṛṇuvakṣyāmitedevisvarahasyaṃcakā
madam śrutvāguptatamaṃgopyaṃkurugu
ptaṃsureśvari kavacaṃbagalāmukhyāḥ

<pṛ0 1ba> sakaleṣṭapradaṃkalau matsarvasvaṃparaṃgu
hyaṃguptaṃcaśarajanmanaḥ trailokyavija
yaṃnāmakavaceśaṃmanoramaṃ maṃtragarbhaṃ
maṃtrarūpaṃsiddhavidyāvināyakaṃ 

<pṛ0 2a> rahasyaṃparamaṃjñaṃyaṃsākṣādamṛtarū
piṇaṃ vrahmavidyāmayaṃvatsedurla
bhaṃprāṇināṃkalau pūrṇamekonapaṃ
cāśadvarṇairmaṃtramayairyutaṃ tvadbhaktyāva

<pṛ0 2ba> cmideveśigopanīyaṃsuyonivat 
devyuvāca bhagavatkaruṇāsāraviśva
nāthasureśvara karmaṇāmanasāvācāna
vacyagnibhuvepica bhairavuvāca trai

<pṛ0 3a> lokyavijayākhyasyakavacasyāsya
pārvati maṃtragarbhasyaguptasyṛṣirde
vastubhairavaḥ uṣṇikchaṃdaścaśakti
syātsvāhākīlakamucyate || 

<pṛ0 3ba> viniyogaḥsamākhyātaḥtrivargaphala
sādhane asyaśrītrailokyavijayanā
mnomaṃtragarbhasyaśrībagalāmukhīka
vacasya bhairavṛṣiḥ uṣṇikchaṃdaḥ

<pṛ0 4a> śrīṃbagalāmukhīdevatā hlīṃvījaṃ oṃ
śaktiḥ svāhākīlakaṃ trivargaphala
sādhaneviniyogaḥ bhairavuvāca devīṃ
dhyātvājapedvarmamaṃtragarbhaṃsureśvari 

<pṛ0 4ba> vinādhyānenanosiddhiḥsatyaṃjñāpaya
pārvati athadhyānaṃ caṃdrodbhāsita
mūrdhajāṃtrinayanāṃmuṃḍākṣamālākarāṃ 
vālāṃpītasragujjvalāṃmadhumadāraktāṃjaṭājūṭinīm  

<pṛ0 5a> śatrustaṃbhanakāriṇīṃśaśimukhīṃ
pītāṃvarodbhāsitāṃ pretasthāṃvagalā
mukhīṃbhagavatīṃkāruṇyarūpāṃbhaje  
itidhyānaṃ oṃhlīṃmamaśiraḥpātude

<pṛ0 5ba> vīhlīṃvagalāmukhī oṃaiṃklīṃpātume
bhālaṃdevīstaṃbhanakāriṇī oṃaṃ
īṃhaṃbhruvaupātubagalākleśahā
riṇī oṃhaṃkṣaṃḥpātumenetrenā

<pṛ0 6a> rasiṃhīśubhaṃkarī oṃhrīṃśrīṃpātumegaṃ
ḍauaṃāṃīṃbhuvaneśvarī oṃaiṃklīṃsaḥ
śrutīpātuīṃuṃūṃvaṭeśvarī oṃkrīṃ
huṃhrīṃsadāvyānmenāsāṃḍāṃḷṃsarasva

<pṛ0 6ba> tī oṃhrīṃhrāṃmemukhaṃpātuḹṃoṃaiṃ
chinnamastikā oṃśrīṃdaṃmedharaupā
tuoṃauṃdakṣiṇakālikā oṃhrīṃhuṃbhaiṃ
radānpātuaṃaḥbhaiṃbhadrakālikā 

<pṛ0 7a> oṃkrīṃśrīṃśāṃrasāṃpātukaṃkhaṃgaṃghaṃca
śārikā oṃaiṃsauṃḥmehanuṃpātuṅaṃcaṃ
chaṃjaṃmanonmanā oṃśrīṃśrīṃmegalaṃpā
tujhaṃñaṃṭaṃṭhaṃgaṇeśvarī oṃhrīṃskaṃdausa

<pṛ0 7ba> dāvyānmeḍaṃḍhaṃṇaṃcaivatottalā oṃhrīṃ
śrīṃmebhujaupātutaṃthaṃdaṃvaravarṇinī oṃ
klīṃsauṃḥmestanaupātudhaṃnaṃpaṃparame
śvarī oṃkraṃkaṃmerakṣedvakṣaḥphaṃbaṃ

<pṛ0 8a> bhaṃbhagavāsinī oṃkrīṃkraṃhrīṃpātume
kukṣiṃmaṃyaṃraṃvahnivallabhā oṃśrīṃhrīṃpā
tumepārśvolaṃvaṃlaṃvodaraprasūḥ oṃhrīṃ
huṃpātumenābhiṃśaṃṣaṃṣaṇmukhapāli

<pṛ0 8ba> nī oṃaiṃsauṃḥpātumepṛṣṭaṃsaṃhaṃhāṭa
karūpiṇī oṃklīṃaiṃpātumeśiśnaṃ
laṃkṣaṃhaṃtatvarūpiṇī oṃkrīṃhuṃmekaṭiṃpā
tupaṃcāśadvarṇamātṛkā oṃaiṃhrīṃpātumeguhyaṃ

<pṛ0 9a> aṃāṃkaṃguhyakeśvarī oṃśrīṃuṃhuṃsadā
vyānmeiṃīṃkhaṃkhagagāminī oṃjuṃsaḥ
pātumejānūuṃūṃgaṃgaṇavallabhā oṃ
śrīṃhrīṃpātumejaṃgheṭaṃṭāṃghaṃaghahāriṇī 

<pṛ0 9ba> oṃśrīṃsaḥpātumegulphauḷṃḹṃṅaṃcaṃ
cacaṃḍikā oṃaiṃhrīṃpātumepārśveeṃ
aiṃbhaṃjaṃjagatpriyā oṃśrīṃklīṃpātu
mepādauoṃauṃjhaṃñaṃbhagodarā hlīṃme

<pṛ0 10a> sarvaṃvapuḥpātuaṃaḥhlīṃtripureśva
rī oṃśrīṃpūrvesadāvyānmeaṃāṃṭaṃṭhaṃ
śikhāmukhī oṃhrīṃyāmyāṃsadāvyā
nmeṇaṃḍaṃḍhaṃṇaṃcatāriṇīṃ śrīṃhrīṃmāṃ

<pṛ0 10ba> pātuvāruṇyāṃīṃtaṃthaṃdaṃcakhecarī oṃ
yaṃmāṃpātukauveryāṃtaṃdhaṃnaṃpaṃpilaṃ
pilā oṃśrīṃmāṃpātucaiśānyāṃūṃphaṃ
vaṃvaiṃdaveśvarī oṃśrīṃsauṃḥpātucāgne

<pṛ0 11a> yyāṃṛṃbhaṃmaṃyaṃcayoginī oṃaiṃmāṃpā
tunaiṛtyāṃṭāṃraṃrājeśvarīsadā oṃ
śrīṃmāṃpātuvāyavyāṃḹṃlaṃmāṃlaṃvi(-)
keśinī oṃprabhātecamāṃpātuḷvaṃvā

<pṛ0 11ba> gīśvarītathā madhyāhnecamāṃpātu
eṃmāṃśaṃkaravallabhā hrīṃśrīṃklīṃpātu
māṃsāyaṃaiṃīṃśākaṃbharīsadā hrīṃni
śādautumāṃpātuoṃsaṃsāgaraśāyanī 

<pṛ0 12a> klīṃniśīthecamāṃpātuoṃhaṃhari
hareśvarī klīṃvrāhmemāṃmuhūrtevyā
daṃlaṃtripurasuṃdarī vismāritaṃtu
yatsthānaṃvarjitaṃkavacenatu || 

<pṛ0 12ba> hlīṃtanaumesakalaṃpātuaṃkṣaṃḥhlīṃva
galāmukhī itīdaṃkavacaṃguhyaṃmaṃtrā
kṣaramayaṃparam trailokyavijayaṃnā
masarvavarṇamayaṃsmṛtam aprakā

<pṛ0 13a> śyamadātavyamaśrotavyamavāci
kaṃ durjanāyākulīnāyadīkṣā
hīnāyapārvati nadātavyaṃna
dātavyamityājñāpārameśvarī 

<pṛ0 13ba> adīkṣitatapādyāyavihīnaḥ
śaktibhaktimān kavacasyāsyapa
ṭhanātsādhakodīkṣitobhavet kava
ceśamidaṃgopyaṃsiddhavidyāmayaṃparam 

<pṛ0 14a> vrahmavidyāmayaṃgopyaṃyathābhīṣṭa
phalapradam nakasyakathitaṃcaita
ttrailokyavijayeśvaram asyasmara
ṇamātreṇadevīsadyovaśībhavet 

<pṛ0 14ba> paṭhanāddhāraṇāccāsyakavaceśasya
sādhakaḥ kalauvicaratevīroya(-)
thāhlīṃbagalāmukhī imaṃvarma
smaranmaṃtrīsaṃgrāmaṃpraviśedyadā 

<pṛ0 15a> triḥpaṭhetkavaceśaṃtuyuyutsuḥsādha
kottamaḥ śatrūnkālasamānāṃstuji
tvāsvagṛhameṣyati mūrdhnidhṛtvāca
kavacaṃmaṃtragarbhaṃtusādhakaḥ vra

<pṛ0 15ba> hmādyānamarānsarvānsahasāvaśamā
nayet dhṛtvāgaletukavacaṃsādhaka
syamaheśvari vaśamāyātisa
hasāraṃbhādyāpsarasāṃgaṇaḥ | 

<pṛ0 16a> utpāteṣucaghoreṣubhayeṣuvividhe
ṣuca rogeṣukavaceśaṃcamaṃtragarbhaṃ
paṭhennaraḥ karmaṇāmanasāvācāta
dbhayaṃśāṃtimeṣyati śrīdevyāvaga

<pṛ0 16ba> lāmukhyāḥkavaceśaṃsudurlabham 
trailokyavijayaṃnāmanadeyaṃya
syakasyacit akulīnāyamūḍhā
yabhaktihīnāyadaṃbhine lobhayuktā

<pṛ0 17a> yadeveśinadātavyaṃkadācana śi
ṣyāyabhaktiyuktāyagurubhaktiparā
yaca lobhadaṃbhavihīnāyakavaceśaṃ
pradīyatāṃ abhaktebhyopiputrebhyoda

<pṛ0 17ba> ttvākuṣṭībhavennaraḥ ravaurātraucare
ddehīsnānaṃpūjāṃgṛhaṃvrajet dīpamu
